# Regenerated on every run by scripts/report.py — tracking them is pure churn.
# The readable output (out/RANKINGS.md) and the point-in-time network
# measurement (out/netcheck.json) ARE tracked: one is the deliverable, the
# other cannot be reproduced later because it measures a moment on a network.
out/scores-*.json
out/scores-*.csv

# check_stock.py output. Not tracked, unlike netcheck.json, because it decays
# rather than dates: a stock reading is worthless a week later, and 54 of its 60
# rows say "no-markers" (meaning "learned nothing"). The findings that mattered
# are written into REPORT.md and stamped per row as `stock_checked`.
out/stock-check.json
